        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer versus game, set on Zhifu Island, a mysterious small island in the East of China</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of the game is similar to CS. It can be played solo or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Final battle in zhifudao&quot; is a first-person shooter game centered around teamwork, and its gameplay mechanics primarily encompass the following aspects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Camp confrontation mechanism: Players are divided into two major camps: the CT (Counter-Terrorist) camp and the T (Terrorist) camp, engaging in offensive and defensive battles through a turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. CT needs to prevent T from planting bombs or rescuing hostages, while T needs to complete their objective or eliminate all opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Both sides will score by capturing the flag, and they can engage in combat during the scoring process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The free-for-all mode allows you to eliminate all enemies alone, without any concerns about teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Weapons and equipment mechanics: The game offers a variety of realistic firearms, including the AK-47, AWP, etc., each with significant differences in attributes such as recoil and rate of fire. Additionally, there are grenades and other throwables that can help players alter the battlefield situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive mode mechanism: Typically, it adopts multiplayer versus ranked matches, with each team consisting of up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131270/extras/f7b97bdeb39693c479de83c991b80b3f.avif?t=1765856191\" width=882 height=497 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a multiplayer versus game, set on Zhifu Island, a mysterious small island in the East of China</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay of the game is similar to CS. It can be played solo or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Final battle in zhifudao&quot; is a first-person shooter game centered around teamwork, and its gameplay mechanics primarily encompass the following aspects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Camp confrontation mechanism: Players are divided into two major camps: the CT (Counter-Terrorist) camp and the T (Terrorist) camp, engaging in offensive and defensive battles through a turn-based system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. CT needs to prevent T from planting bombs or rescuing hostages, while T needs to complete their objective or eliminate all opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Both sides will score by capturing the flag, and they can engage in combat during the scoring process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. The free-for-all mode allows you to eliminate all enemies alone, without any concerns about teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Weapons and equipment mechanics: The game offers a variety of realistic firearms, including the AK-47, AWP, etc., each with significant differences in attributes such as recoil and rate of fire. Additionally, there are grenades and other throwables that can help players alter the battlefield situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Competitive mode mechanism: Typically, it adopts multiplayer versus ranked matches, with each team consisting of up to 16 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131270/extras/f7b97bdeb39693c479de83c991b80b3f.avif?t=1765856191\" width=882 height=497 /></span></p>",
